{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 7795755529882484107,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Mecrisp-quintus forth environment for IceStick",
      "source_hash": 87689316684486484,
      "context_hash": 16389427493912301721,
      "translation": "IceStick용 Mecrisp-quintus forth 환경",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030095Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "This directory contains the bitstream for the mecrisp-quintus forth environment, ported to FemtoRV32 by Matthias Koch, the author of mecrisp.",
      "source_hash": 14641460345157250172,
      "context_hash": 13934055798531165692,
      "translation": "이 디렉터리에는 mecrisp의 저자인 Matthias Koch가 FemtoRV32로 포팅한 mecrisp-quintus forth 환경의 비트스트림이 들어 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Mecrisp is licensed under GPLv3.",
      "source_hash": 2320209043516902861,
      "context_hash": 5537397216988304494,
      "translation": "Mecrisp는 GPLv3 라이선스로 배포됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030096Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Refer to [mecrisp website](http://mecrisp.sourceforge.net/) for sources and more information.",
      "source_hash": 188543759487041766,
      "context_hash": 13453895532069264844,
      "translation": "소스와 더 많은 정보는 [mecrisp website](http://mecrisp.sourceforge.net/)를 참고하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030097Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "What follows is a minitutorial.",
      "source_hash": 1532929253254215235,
      "context_hash": 2487404108824938892,
      "translation": "이어지는 내용은 미니 튜토리얼입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030097Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: Synthetize FemtoRV and FemtoSOC for mecrisp-quintus",
      "source_hash": 4040624537386958891,
      "context_hash": 1848727919372030864,
      "translation": "1단계: mecrisp-quintus용 FemtoRV와 FemtoSOC 합성",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "FemtoRV": "FemtoRV"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030097Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Synthetize femtorv32 (configured for mecrisp quintus) and send it to the IceStick:",
      "source_hash": 11078538189283321107,
      "context_hash": 13729032282614160095,
      "translation": "femtorv32(mecrisp quintus용으로 구성됨)를 합성하고 IceStick으로 전송합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030099Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: Program",
      "source_hash": 11750291163830984059,
      "context_hash": 11284429869549481216,
      "translation": "2단계: 프로그래밍",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030099Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Send mecrisp-quintus to the SPI flash of the IceStick",
      "source_hash": 13252216968885754110,
      "context_hash": 13955220859465249887,
      "translation": "mecrisp-quintus를 IceStick의 SPI 플래시로 전송합니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030099Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3: It's alive !",
      "source_hash": 16569348568741292491,
      "context_hash": 18196007502139902411,
      "translation": "3단계: 살아났다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030099Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Connect to it with a terminal (you will need to install `picocom`).",
      "source_hash": 16627140532465020828,
      "context_hash": 6493993262155067600,
      "translation": "터미널로 연결합니다(`picocom` 설치가 필요합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "(it works also with other terminals, but picocom has more functionalities).",
      "source_hash": 9863275922203679263,
      "context_hash": 15053208881247457798,
      "translation": "(다른 터미널로도 작동하지만, picocom이 더 많은 기능을 제공합니다).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Picocom hotkeys",
      "source_hash": 12436846012582365645,
      "context_hash": 10666028949791424416,
      "translation": "Picocom 단축키",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "Key",
      "source_hash": 1178192695558671955,
      "context_hash": 9684525814731925444,
      "translation": "키",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "Function",
      "source_hash": 12017511910326844596,
      "context_hash": 2513064161089579894,
      "translation": "기능",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "`<ctrl><a> <ctrl><t>`",
      "source_hash": 1232844844063132924,
      "context_hash": 17187866661584444137,
      "translation": "`<ctrl><a> <ctrl><t>`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "reset femtorv32",
      "source_hash": 5483770567871795925,
      "context_hash": 4229270476182578663,
      "translation": "femtorv32 리셋",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:9/seg:0",
      "source": "`<ctrl><a> <ctrl><x>`",
      "source_hash": 13985147267951058401,
      "context_hash": 2010391239172880435,
      "translation": "`<ctrl><a> <ctrl><x>`",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:10/seg:0",
      "source": "exit picocom",
      "source_hash": 14461183674125404067,
      "context_hash": 15950315750290658889,
      "translation": "picocom 종료",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:11/seg:0",
      "source": "Try some forth commands and debugger:",
      "source_hash": 5695005539607157721,
      "context_hash": 13789243313627784678,
      "translation": "몇 가지 forth 명령어와 디버거를 사용해 보십시오:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030100Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:0",
      "source": "_I must admit I do not know how to do more, it is a shame !_ I need to learn Forth, it is a wonderful language, minimalistic and elegant.",
      "source_hash": 7633384322614327502,
      "context_hash": 9111005647447532499,
      "translation": "*더 이상 할 줄 아는 게 없다는 걸 인정해야겠습니다, 부끄러운 일입니다!* Forth를 배워야겠습니다. 이는 훌륭한 언어이며, 미니멀하면서도 우아합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030101Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:1",
      "source": "Look: the environment, commands, compiler, assembler simulator fits in 64k, amazing !",
      "source_hash": 2327165542910412166,
      "context_hash": 2696386148547266306,
      "translation": "보십시오: 환경, 명령어, 컴파일러, 어셈블러 시뮬레이터가 64k 안에 들어갑니다, 놀랍습니다!",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030101Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:13/seg:2",
      "source": "Would be great to pack in there a couple of nice demos (and we got nearly 4MB of flash for that !!).",
      "source_hash": 8493012751245090946,
      "context_hash": 6898421833184779301,
      "translation": "거기에 멋진 데모 몇 개를 채워 넣으면 좋을 것입니다(그리고 그것을 위한 거의 4MB의 플래시 용량도 있습니다!!).",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-09-08T00:53:16.030101Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
